      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "And for the same reason, and also since the notification which covers the subject matter has been issued, the instant reference may not require any determination and it would only be an academic exercise to answer after hearing the parties."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ff6611689ba24ab0a0a25bf952c44c1c_28",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, this reference stands disposed of."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "617bfc4c84aa4f20b663e316e51c681f_36",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Relevant paras are extracted hereinunder."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fc07d4e34cb6417080128e47f8203806_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The offence alleged against the appellant is underSection 2(ix)(k), read with Rule 32 of the PFA, which was made punishable underSection 16(1)(a)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b65dfa0179694076b3fbe0c0575a0e4a_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In short, the allegation was that the label on the food product of the appellant was not in accordance with the requirements of the PFA and the Rules framed thereunder."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ed1a079050e1453ba9bed26b9cbc791c_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the definition of 'misbranded' underSection 2 (ix)will apply."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1674efeb993e44bd9471d00d8e6d91df_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Clause (ix) ofSection 2of PFA"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8575e162953548a1bbf31da5ad01934b_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "reads thus:\n\"(ix) \"misbranded\"?an article of food shall be deemed to be misbranded?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8b46a14e77e949ffbe33967958a964c7_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(a) if it is an imitation of, or is a substitute for, or resembles in a(2020) 10 SCC 751 manner likely to deceive, another article of food under the name of which it is sold,\nand is not plainly and conspicuously labelled so as to indicate i"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "956d69af1b14444c825808512b90c66f_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The corresponding provision under the FSSA is clause (zf) ofSection 3which reads thus:\n\"(zf) \"misbranded food\" means an article of food?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ec8959ae928d45b181c16588b853b760_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(A) if it is purported, or is represented to be, or is being?\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0e88597f783043658a8011f8db793ed9_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "( i ) offered or promoted for sale with false, misleading or deceptive claims either;"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "49ec131c57484278a1e2d93723c08525_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(a) upon the label of the package, or (b) through advertisement, or (ii) sold by a name which belongs to another article of food; or (iii) offered or promoted for sale under the name of a fictitious individual or company as the manufacturer"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a0c3c354135b44ec8643184e6b1f409a_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "( i) the article is an imitation of, or is a substitute for, or resembles in a manner likely to deceive, another article of food under the name of which it is sold, and is not plainly and conspicuously labelled so as to indicate its true ch"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "149eae86667e4557be5ebb536f9576ad_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(ii) the package containing the article or the label on the package bears any statement, design or device regarding the ingredients or the substances contained therein, which is false or misleading in any material particular, or if the pack"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e9c071018fa54293a25007400ac5d103_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Sub-clause (A) (i) deals with food being offered or promoted for sale with false, misleading or deceptive claims upon the package's label."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0202f6280d2943d6a306c02844ad4c91_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n11. UnderSection 16of PFA, penalties have been prescribed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "56c3d02eaf6245a38a9d0a8461e89a78_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Under clause 1(i) of sub-section (1)\nofSection 16, misbranding within the meaning of Clause (ix) ofSection 2is an offence punishable with imprisonment for a term which may not be less than six months, but it may extend to three years and wi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5ba92d1b907b443f91878c28334bdfac_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The procedure for taking cognizance is prescribed bySection 20.\n12."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cea95b5cda2b4fd1b68d07629a7b0cd5_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As against this, Section 52 of FSSA provides for penalties for misbranded food."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "94e9928349454f508e488d47b174109b_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "FSSA does not prescribe any punishment of imprisonment for misbranding, but the power under Section 52 is to impose a penalty, which may extend to Rupees 3 lakhs."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4575654b108b43988ae7c1851cafdd49_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "13. Thus, under the provisions of the PFA, for misbranding, a person can be sentenced to imprisonment of a minimum six months with a fine of Rupees one thousand and more."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c42df2826c754b809198dfeb7fc19f22_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However,\nfor a similar violation under the FSSA, there is no penal provision in the sense that there is no provision for sentencing the violator to undergo imprisonment and to pay a fine."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c01280d55ed3475784d15797a6f91296_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Under the FSSA,\nonly a penalty of up to Rupees 3 lakhs can be imposed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "97cf7ad36ded4d4a97f316ae7b7c7207_59",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. We must note here thatSections 4,5,6,7,8,9,10,87,88,91 and 101 were brought into force with effect from 15th October 2007.Section 3of the FSSA which defines 'misbranded food' came into force on 28th May 2008."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "25e64b1c955645eea363e1e6809ee368_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As noted earlier, Section 97 which provides for repeal of the PFA was brought into force on 5th August 2011."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6e4d99fdfa534847b5362af88305c322_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, the penal provisions of the PFA were in force till 5th August 2011."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6179e5472157428584d665048e71693a_62",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this case, the alleged offence was committed on 29th November 2010."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "81be7f0ea5be4481a14005e157faefe2_64",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "From the above quoted paras of the aforesaid judgment, particularly, in para 14 and the notification dated 05.08.2011 as also the judgment of the Full Bench of this Court, which took note of the notification dated 05.08.2011, this Court fin"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "76664142b6f04a6299ba97a3dd2f6283_65",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, all the petition(s) are dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5f4afc6aa2ce43df8fcc1478eb955697_66",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "16. The liberty is given to the petitioner(s) to place their case before the Magistrate, based upon the observations made by Hon'ble Apex Court in the judgment passed in Manik Hiru Jhangiani (supra)\nand other relevant provisions of FSSA inc"
    }
